    "text": "Let $(1+x)^{10}=\\sum_{r=0}^{10} c_{r} x^{r}$ and $(1+x)^{7}=\\sum_{r=0}^{7} d_{r} x^{r}$\r\nIf $P=\\sum_{r=0}^{5} c_{2}$ and $Q=\\sum_{r=0}^{3} d_{2 r+1},$ then $\\frac{P}{Q}$ is equal\r\nto"
