  "solution": {
    "text": "$P=\\sum_{r=0}^{5} C_{2 r}$\r\n$={ }^{10} C_{0}+{ }^{10} C_{2}+\\quad+{ }^{10} C_{10}=\\frac{2^{0}}{2}=2^{9}$\r\n$Q=\\sum_{r=0}^{3} d_{2 r+1}=d_{1}+d_{3}+d_{5}+d_{7}$\r\n$={ }^{7} C_{1}+{ }^{7} C_{3}+{ }^{7} C_{5}+{ }^{7} C_{7}=\\frac{2^{7}}{2}=2^{6}$\r\n$\\therefore \\frac{P}{\\Omega}=\\frac{2^{9}}{3^{6}}=2^{3}=8$"
